Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:26.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These aren't Seeno Evils!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:27.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're Haters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:30.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've done too much to stand out in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.59,0:00:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:35.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are Haters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:41.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy and spite created Haters\Nof you girls from among the Seeno Evils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:45.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't have the guts to show\Ntheir faces, but they do have madness.{mad or angry?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:46.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're strong in groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:48.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe as strong as a boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run or hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're after you: the "heroes" in the limelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:57.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're "heroes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is your cut okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Great.\NWhat's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:11.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoshida Yae.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.26,0:01:13.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yae, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:16.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hide here until the bell rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.13,0:01:19.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't clear the mission if you don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:23.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, focus on maintaining the status quo for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a solution in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Yae is hurt.{TODO maybe it}\NIt's my fault she—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:30.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.87,0:01:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'll regenerate in as little as ten minutes in her Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:37.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn, they found us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Protect the Egg girl until time runs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:41.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's your top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:44.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Society is built on "report, contact, consult."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:46.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say it out loud and share it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:49.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our greatest objective is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:51.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Egg...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.14,0:01:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai.\NCome on, it's time for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:38.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on. Get up and help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.19,0:03:53.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:08.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made you omelet rice for lunch.\NI know how much you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did? Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:13.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'll make us sukiyaki for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:16.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? You love sukiyaki, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only make it on special days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:27.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai, would you have a proper talk with Mr. Sawaki today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:38.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's really concerned about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:41.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you think about the future, at least a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:49.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:51.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:54.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You went to school like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:17.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup. Glistening lips and eyes like a panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:18.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A panda?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:20.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:22.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she's skipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:27.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:31.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now she's lashing out.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.01,0:05:36.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why's she doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.09,0:05:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Maybe something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had a nightmare like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:46.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It ended horribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:50.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's just watch for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:56.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. I see you managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:59.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what's with those Haters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:02.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who asked them to treat us like\Nheroes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.16,0:06:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not doing this for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, they can't be reasoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who stand out pay for it, \Nin any time and in any world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:15.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you "had a solution in mind"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:17.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Look, here it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:19.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That case contains things that will support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:29.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically, it's what you call a "power up."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:31.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I doubt we'll get to use it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you've got something that handy, say so sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are extremely valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.32,0:06:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have you losing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means, "Don't get used to it, idiots."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:57.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:06:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can have them free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:01.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One each, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pendants?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pomanders, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:08.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how do we use them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:13.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, you hatch them in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:14.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hatch them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not so difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They respond to body heat, so clasp \Nthem in both hands and gently rub them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, but don't do it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go home and open them when you're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:30.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They require imprinting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:33.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They see whoever meets their gaze first as their parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chant "{\i1}veni{\i0}" to call them from their eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"{\i1}Redi{\i0}" to return them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Latin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:42.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope my baby's a hottie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.27,0:07:46.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what types do you think are in them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't imprinted yet, so we can trade, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:52.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wanna swap with me, Neiru?\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:56.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope you get the ugliest helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:07.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:10.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seem different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:15.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1453.33,1017)}I'm leaving now, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:27.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1453.33,1017)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:02.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.19,0:09:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We've got backup this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:06.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:16.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:19.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haters are their favorite food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy and spite are their bread and butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That should solve our Hater problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:34.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:42.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yae, why did you kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:47.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dead people, strong grudges...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like {\i1}The Sixth Sense{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See?! No one will believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.32,0:10:00.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are unbelievably scary things that only I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:04.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.15,0:10:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:09.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My friends left because it creeped them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My parents and teachers wouldn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In fact, they thought I was crazy and put me in a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:19.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what really scared me was what came next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.59,0:10:26.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hospital was overflowing\Nwith lots of people's resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:28.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was way worse than ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those people's voices and their terrifying faces
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,poured into my head day in and day out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.27,0:10:36.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:40.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, a boss is coming. I'll get ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's already here!\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:00.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Ohto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's dinner time, so dry your hair quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:11.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:13.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.16,0:11:15.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:18.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NHe's staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:27.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:34.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai, wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:35.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's school, I need a little more—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:44.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not school. Just sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen calmly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:03.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been thinking that we'd like to start dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:16.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, we're not going to do\Nanything if you're not okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:33.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My uncle and Ai's mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means we might end up being family!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:40.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you excited about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:42.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does she look happy to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:49.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you against it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:53.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told them to do whatever. It's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:56.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you fought as hard as you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:13:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that I wouldn't take care of them \Nor live with them in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:03.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said I'd put them in a home and only visit sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.71,0:13:06.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice. You really let 'em have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why? Do you feel bad for your real dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:13.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're already divorced, and\NDad might have someone new himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:17.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, there's no problem—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:23.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you listen to people, Momoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean that my uncle might have been\Ninvolved in Koito's suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what if there was?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's younger than Ai's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'd be her younger live-in boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:36.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:39.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"So"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:42.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Live-in boyfriends are always abusing their girlfriends' kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Violently if it's a son, sexually if it’s a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.39,0:13:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but don't lump my uncle \Nin with the men your mom's dated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:57.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean it's possible that Mr.\NSawaki likes young girls like us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.69,0:14:01.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,meaning that Ai's mom is a decoy and he's really after Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.41,0:14:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way. Besides, he knows that Ai's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:08.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:11.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,don't like not knowing about Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they marry, you'll have to cover\Nfor him to protect your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:25.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Momo. That's not what I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What on Earth are they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:29.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:34.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not what clothes would go with\Nthose necklaces, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:39.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, family matters take\Nprecedence over life-or-death battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll never know the truth\Nunless we bring Koito back and ask her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.57,0:14:46.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Occam's razor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There might be a factor complicating matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NWhat? There's {\i1}more{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai likes Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"The simplest theory is the best."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Neiru?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:06.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're wrong! I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:08.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Emotional!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Complicated and emotional!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:14.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't! That's totally impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask to be able to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.72,0:15:30.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not your friend or anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.11,0:15:56.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:15:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.11,0:16:00.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, don't kill that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:08.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prayer beads?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:16.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean that my uncle might have been\Ninvolved in Koito's suicide?{TODO brain?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.59,0:16:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been thinking that we'd like to start dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:35.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There might be a factor complicating matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.23,0:16:39.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to have a complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai likes Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:56.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:16:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:06.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:07.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.29,0:17:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:45.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can see me, Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I can't be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet it was tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dealing with these monsters all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.40,0:18:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:17.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your name is Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not very creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:26.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:32.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai, Mr. Sawaki is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:41.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you next week, Ohto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the bath, Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:09.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't leave your dirty clothes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:11.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do I always tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:14.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Turn the pockets inside-out for washing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.31,0:19:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll leave what was in your pockets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:26.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:28.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll catch a—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:29.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:33.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.70,0:19:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,School!\NHuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:13.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Mr. S.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.53,0:20:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:34.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:45.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The sky is clear and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:52.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a passing shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:55.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:03.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.07,0:21:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,going to go to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
